&lt;p&gt;
	The respected officer inspected and advised through email on 22 January through various instructions, which were complied with and after completion of the work on her esteemed advice, the reverent officer was requested on 04, February to please re-inspect the Zaini&amp;#39;s Food. Accordingly, she visited on the 10th February and loved the inside premises and praised almost everything managed therein. However, she advised to complete the daily diary and Manager book etc. as there were some deficiencies. Anyhow, she explained that for ratings requests will have to be generated. We saw 1* rating on the website, which is not understandable. Madam Officer is requested to please review the decision.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
	In anyway, as per instructions given on the 21st January, we have worked hard and made everything as per instructions. Pack was completed for safe food with safer method and started completed diary. Handwash and blue roll were supplied. Back yard rubbis was removed and cleaned to prevent pests. Oil containers were covered with lids and contract has been signed with oil collector. All other instructions were followed and work was completed. The respected officer is prayed to please review ratings.&lt;/p&gt;
